{"version":1,"content":"<p>現年44歲的台灣歌手張韶涵長年在內地演出，近日被拍到低調回台，被捕捉到進出男星言承旭同棟高級社區，甚至身穿全身名牌直奔錄音室展開秘密行程。</p><p>這趟極度隱密的返台動作突然曝光，此行的真實目的，立即引發網上熱烈討論。</p><p>&lt;br/&gt;&lt;b</p>","scraped_at":"2026-11-03T18:21:16.148734+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":113,"images":0,"source":"東網 娛樂","fallback":"rss-budget","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-11-03T18:01:19+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-03T18:18:16.947574+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-03T18:18:16.947574+00:00","content_hash":"7816b59598727cec6e1c66a55d51ba64a49d01075ffa6411c776b87031a24323","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}